      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JINDONG EXPRESS (2) had the drop on the lead before drawing clear to score (22.58) at this track in Novice race over 400m. The hardest to beat again. SOUL SURFER (1) showed strong early pace and proved too slick around this track over 400m in 22.80, claiming a Grade 5/6 by half a length. Can make it back-to-back wins. HE'S SAVVY (5) goes very well at the distance with two wins and a placing from five starts. In the money last time at Cannington (22.02) in a Grade 5, finishing a 0.8 lengths third. Looks a key chance on best figures. TRUNKEY MISS (4) will have admirers again after placing at this track and distance last time out.",
